30:["$","p","They’ve introduced a broad array of AI-powered and AR/ VR-based virtual learning platforms, with an extensive set of facilities, including online assessments, instant feedback mechanisms, personalized and enhanced learning, and many others.",{"className":"mt-5 text-base leading-8 text-muted-foreground","children":"They’ve introduced a broad array of AI-powered and AR/ VR-based virtual learning platforms, with an extensive set of facilities, including online assessments, instant feedback mechanisms, personalized and enhanced learning, and many others."}]
31:["$","p","These developments and regular upgrades have helped grow the online learning space and the effectiveness of online education, thereby making it a trustworthy, safe, and personalized learning medium, especially during these adverse times. So, how does online learning benefit users, and what are the shortcomings of the virtual learning medium? Come, let us take a look.",{"className":"mt-5 text-base leading-8 text-muted-foreground","children":"These developments and regular upgrades have helped grow the online learning space and the effectiveness of online education, thereby making it a trustworthy, safe, and personalized learning medium, especially during these adverse times. So, how does online learning benefit users, and what are the shortcomings of the virtual learning medium? Come, let us take a look."}]
32:["$","p","Larger Groups can create Confusions while Learning: Short attention spans, coupled with several distractions, can prove an obstacle to the learning process. But what proves even more annoying for the students and the teachers is the presence of large unmanaged students, wherein several students ask questions at a time, some cannot hear the teacher, some suddenly disappear, and some disconnect due to network issues, etc.",{"className":"mt-5 text-base leading-8 text-muted-foreground","children":"Larger Groups can create Confusions while Learning: Short attention spans, coupled with several distractions, can prove an obstacle to the learning process. But what proves even more annoying for the students and the teachers is the presence of large unmanaged students, wherein several students ask questions at a time, some cannot hear the teacher, some suddenly disappear, and some disconnect due to network issues, etc."}]
